{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":491074,"name":"Laercio Albuquerque","username":"Laercio_Albuquerque","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/258eb7/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T16:51:31.502Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491074-app-grok-bot-desktop-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491074-app-grok-bot-desktop-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eApp: Grok Bot desktop\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIssue: Cannot access computer — “Não foi possível acessar seu computador”. Bots are safe but cannot load.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Restart PC\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Logout/login\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Check for Updates (does not work / unavailable in this state)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Recuperar computador → “A redefinição falhou” (partial state)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Tentar redefinir novamente → failed again\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Help → Send Feedback → “não foi possível entregar esse relato”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://status.cursor.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003estatus.cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e shows All Systems Operational / Grok Bot Operational at time of report (2026-09-14 afternoon BRT). Agents still respond via another client path; only desktop computer access is broken.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease re-provision / reattach Grok Bot’s computer for this account from the server side. I would like a response from support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTimezone: America/Sao_Paulo. Forum username: Laercio_Albuquerque. Email used for forum: \u003ca href=\"mailto:laercioalbuq@proton.me\"\u003elaercioalbuq@proton.me\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T11:28:26.591Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":25.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171644,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-desktop-cannot-access-computer-recover-reset-fails-twice-partial-state","display_username":"Laercio Albuquerque","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://status.cursor.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor Status","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137765,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-desktop-cannot-access-computer-recover-reset-fails-twice-partial-state/171644/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":491552,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T08:23:33.861Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/laercio_albuquerque\"\u003e@Laercio_Albuquerque\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGood news: your Grok Bot machine is up and healthy on our side, and your account is in good standing. Your bots are still running turns from your phone right now, so there’s nothing to re-provision.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom what we can see, the Grok Bot app on your Windows PC stopped being able to open a secure connection to our servers. It was flaky starting the evening of September 9 and hasn’t reached us at all since September 11. That’s also why “Check for Updates” and “Send Feedback” fail from inside the app.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA couple of things to try:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou’re on an old version of the Grok Bot Client (0.29). Please update to the latest version, available at \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/download/bot\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eCursor · Download Grok Bot\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOnce updated, run Network Diagnostics (Profile \u0026gt; General \u0026gt; Network Debugger) and share  the results.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T08:23:33.861Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171644,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-desktop-cannot-access-computer-recover-reset-fails-twice-partial-state","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://cursor.com/download/bot","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor · Download Grok Bot","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-desktop-cannot-access-computer-recover-reset-fails-twice-partial-state/171644/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":491686,"name":"Laercio Albuquerque","username":"Laercio_Albuquerque","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/258eb7/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T11:28:20.468Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks Colin — resolved.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoot cause was Kaspersky Premium HTTPS / encrypted-connection scanning on Windows. After updating Grok Bot, I added Grok Bot.exe (and Claude) as trusted apps with “Do not scan encrypted traffic”, then re-enabled “Scan encrypted connections upon request from protection components”. Desktop app works again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo need to re-provision. Appreciate the help.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T11:28:20.468Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":45.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171644,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-desktop-cannot-access-computer-recover-reset-fails-twice-partial-state","display_username":"Laercio Albuquerque","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137765,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-desktop-cannot-access-computer-recover-reset-fails-twice-partial-state/171644/7","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[491074,491552,491686]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topi